<title>USA: France finance chief Arthuis favors strong dollar.</title>
<headline>France finance chief Arthuis favors strong dollar.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Saturday that he favored a strong dollar.</p>
<p>At the news conference he declined to be drawn on whether France still favored a stronger dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;I have told you of my support for a strong dollar ... We all stated our support for a strong dollar,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
